The legal texts are copied from Al Meezan (https://almeezan.qa), the legal portal of the Ministry of Justice of
the State of Qatar.

Basis for reuse. Qatar's Law No. 7 of 2002 on the Protection of Copyright and Neighbouring Rights, Article 4(1),
excludes legislation and its official translations from protection. Al Meezan's Terms of Use say that content
may not be copied or reproduced without prior written permission. Both are recorded here; the text is published
under the Article 4(1) exemption and will be withdrawn on request.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
